Remember please that SAE is a metaphysical, not a purely linguistic categor=
y, it is, like sex, about plugs and sockets, not about nouns and verbs.=A0 =
Metaphysically, Lojban is SAE (more so than, say, German even).=A0=20

Much as I dislike Lojban terminology as a rule, it does have its points whe=
n compared to popular terminology (official linguistics stuff is marginally=
 better).=A0=20



